# NoSpotifyDeviceBanner.ascii

## Component: NoSpotifyDeviceBanner
## Layout: fixed-bottom-banner

## Visual Structure:
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 🔇  No Spotify Device                                       [ Check Now ] │ ← banner-row
│     Open Spotify on any device to enable playback                 ◌       │ ← subtitle + spinner
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

## Elements:
| ascii       | type    | text_pattern                                 | region     | cond              |
|-------------|---------|----------------------------------------------|------------|-------------------|
| 🔇          | svg     | speaker-x-mark                               | banner-row | no                |
| Title       | heading | "No Spotify Device"                          | banner-row | no                |
| Subtitle    | text    | "Open Spotify on any device to enable playback" | banner-row | no             |
| Check Now   | button  | "Check Now"                                  | banner-row | !isChecking       |
| ◌           | spinner | -                                            | banner-row | isChecking        |

## States:
| state    | visual changes                                                  |
|----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------|
| hidden   | Not rendered (v-if false): user unauthenticated, non-Spotify, devices present, or pre-first-check |
| visible  | Amber bg (bg-amber-900), border-t-2 amber, z-30, slide-up transition |
| checking | "Check Now" button replaced by spinning SVG                      |
